    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "May I ask, the Jinlan Temple you mentioned earlier—is that where you work?",
      "nextIndex": 13,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectName": "",
          "componentTypeName": "",
          "methodName": "",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerOnEnd": false
        },
        {
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "methodName": "SetZhouShuConv5",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerOnEnd": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Hmm~ Sort of. It's more like my home, actually. I grew up there.",
      "nextIndex": 14,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "I see. I’m not very familiar with the local culture in Yuntai. Are there many Taoist temples like that here?",
      "nextIndex": 15,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Not really. We’re probably the most prominent sect in the city. Jinlan Temple has apparently been around since Yuntai was first established, so it’s got quite a bit of history.",
      "nextIndex": 16,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "That sounds impressive.",
      "nextIndex": 17,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Not at all~ Honestly, ever since I can remember, hardly anyone visits the temple.",
      "nextIndex": 18,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Shifu says it’s because of... cultural shift, or something like that… Anyway, hardly any young people worship the Double Stars nowadays. I guess the temple’s kind of in decline.",
      "nextIndex": 19,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "I see…",
      "nextIndex": 20,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Ah! But don’t worry—no matter how run-down it gets, we won’t be shutting down! It’s still a historical site, after all! My Shifu was even considering raising the ticket price. I think bumping it to ten yuan would fix everything!",
      "nextIndex": 21,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "......(Something tells me this sect isn’t all that reliable...)",
      "conditionalBranches": [
        {
          "targetIndex": 31,
          "priority": 1,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
              "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
