      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Your outfit is quite distinctive—does it have something to do with your profession?",
      "nextIndex": 23,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": [
        {
          "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "componentTypeName": "LevelManager2_1",
          "methodName": "SetZhouShuConv6",
          "parameterType": "None",
          "stringParameter": "",
          "intParameter": 0,
          "floatParameter": 0,
          "boolParameter": false,
          "triggerOnEnd": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Yep! I’m a Taoist priest! Though honestly, it’s not like we’re required to wear this all the time. I just find the robes really comfortable, so I’ve kept wearing them.",
      "nextIndex": 24,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "There aren’t any Taoist priests in Wenqiu City, so I’m curious—what’s a Taoist’s daily life like?",
      "nextIndex": 25,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Nothing too special, really. Our sect focuses more on talismans and spiritual techniques, but I’m terrible at all those complicated rituals and incantations.",
      "nextIndex": 26,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "But I’m pretty fit physically, so I mostly just train my body and practice swordplay...",
      "nextIndex": 27,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "I’m not sure I follow...",
      "nextIndex": 28,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Ah, sorry! I’ve been rambling about all sorts of stuff! Honestly, most of the time I just handle random chores like ticketing and maintenance!",
      "nextIndex": 29,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "Since I can’t remember much history, I’m no good as a tour guide. Even though I’m technically the senior disciple in the temple, I spend most of my days running errands and hauling things around...",
      "nextIndex": 30,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "name": "",
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "content": "(So this is what working at a temple is like...)",
      "conditionalBranches": [
        {
          "targetIndex": 31,
          "priority": 1,
          "conditions": [
            {
              "targetObjectName": "LevelManager2_1",
